# .plan — bill@tianni
# (yes, like carmack's. no, i will not be taking questions.)

2026-07-23  rebuilt the profile as an operating system. the profile now
            maintains itself. i have been made redundant on my own page.
            this was the goal.

2026-07-23  taught the README minesweeper. it calls it fsck. visitors keep
            causing kernel panics. the SMART log remembers every one of them.

2026-07-23  outsourced my bio to a daemon. it is kinder to me than i am.
            it also commits more often.

2026-09-29  redesigned the machine. fourteen windows became four.
            the purple dashboard was never ours; it has been escorted
            out, along with the snake. everything boots from one
            phosphor now. there is a button. do not press it.

2026-09-29  renamed the machine tianni, after the heaven defying bead.
            it was always a bead with an old soul living inside.
            the old soul rewrites my bio twice a week. whitebox was
            a cover story.

